Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
Recommends: xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-2
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver metapackage (TNT/TNT2, GeForce 256, GeForce 2/4 MX (NV0x, NV1x))
 The 71.86.15 driver from the NVIDIA 71xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for jammy.
 .
 Supported hardware: TNT/TNT2, GeForce 256, GeForce 2/4 MX (NV0x, NV1x).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2011. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 2. Very high risk.
 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2204: the shipped X server ABI
 (25) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (2). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically.

Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump,
 nvidia-persistenced and the GTK backends for the 71.86.15 driver.



Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides:
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd,
 libgl1-nvidia-glx,
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-71xx-glx,
 libglx-nvidia,
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver — runtime libraries
 Every shared library from the NVIDIA 71.86.15 userspace: libGL / libGLX_nvidia
 / libEGL_nvidia, libnvidia-glcore, libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore,
 libnvidia-ml, libcuda and friends, plus the GLX X extension module. Install the
 :i386 variant alongside for 32-bit applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-support
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71.86.15 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 71.86.15 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-5.15.0-125-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-5.15.0-125-generic
Provides: nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-5.15.0-125-generic,
 nvidia-legacy-71xx-kernel-modules
Description: NVIDIA legacy 71xx prebuilt module for Linux 5.15.0-125-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 71xx series,
 compiled for the 5.15.0-125-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
